{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o023c","title":"曹操表封荀彧万岁亭侯","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o023c-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"曹操表封荀彧万岁亭侯","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023c-q"]},{"id":"xunyu-a-p018-judgment","label":"《彧别传》","text":"《彧别传》载曹操表功，荀彧辞无野战之劳，曹操致书劝受后乃受。","evidence":["xunyu-q-p018-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"表封","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"受封","evidence":["xunyu-e-o023c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":203,"label":"建安八年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xunyu-y203","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xunyu-q-o023","basis":"建安八年"},"evidence":["xunyu-e-o023c-q","xunyu-q-o023","xunyu-q-b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o023c-q","source_order":[10,121,"O023c"],"order":2430}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0100","name":"荀彧","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o023c-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-64b6e45c68fb16b80ee9","layer":"original","quote":"八年〖4〗，太祖录彧前后功，表封彧为万岁亭侯。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":58,"end":81},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-89fa02f36b1a0d0955da","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xunyu-q-o023","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-64b6e45c68fb16b80ee9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖复次于河上，绍病死。太祖渡河，击绍子谭、尚。而高幹、郭援侵略河东，关右震动。钟繇帅马腾等，击破之，语在《繇传》。八年〖4〗，太祖录彧前后功，表封彧为万岁亭侯。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84},{"id":"xunyu-q-p018-judgment","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-62eb899891a83d6a91ef","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《彧别传》载：“太祖表曰：‘臣闻虑为功首，谋为赏本；野绩不越庙堂，战多不逾国勋。是故曲阜之锡，不后营丘；萧何之土，先于平阳。珍策重计，古今所尚。侍中、守尚书令彧，积德累行，少长无悔；遭世纷扰，怀忠念治。臣自始举义兵，周游征伐；与彧戮力同心，左右王略；发言授策，无施不效。彧之功业，臣由以济；用披浮云，显光日月。陛下幸许，彧左右机近；忠恪祗顺，如履薄冰；研精极锐，以抚庶事。天下之定，彧之功也；宜享高爵，以彰元勋。’彧固辞无野战之劳，不通太祖表。太祖与彧书曰：‘与君共事以来，立朝廷：君之相为匡弼，君之相为举人，君之相为建计，君之相为密谋，亦以多矣！夫功，未必皆野战也，愿君勿让。’彧乃受。”","attribution":"《彧别传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-330568dc26f94e623e0d","start":0,"end":298}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
